## Keys

- PK – Primary key
- FK – Foreign key
- UNIQUE – Unique constraint
- UQ – Composite unique constraint (the combination of store_id and product_id in the INVENTORY table must be unique). Each column can have duplicate values individually.
- NULL – Whether a column allows NULL values

## Foreign Key Constraints

- PRODUCT (supplier_id) → SUPPLIER (supplier_id)
- INVENTORY (store_id) → STORE (store_id)
- INVENTORY (product_id) → PRODUCT (product_id)
- CUSTOMER_ORDER (customer_id) → CUSTOMER (customer_id)
- CUSTOMER_ORDER (store_id) → STORE (store_id)
- ORDER_ITEM (order_id) → CUSTOMER_ORDER (order_id)
- ORDER_ITEM (product_id) → PRODUCT (product_id)
- EMPLOYEE (store_id) → STORE (store_id)
